    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/classic-marketing-agency/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Classic Marketing Agency is a professional, modern, and versatile theme designed for digital marketing firms, creative agencies, branding consultants, advertising companies, PR agencies, media agencies, content creation specialists, marketing strategists, lead generation experts, SEO and SEM service providers, social media managers, event planners, and design studios, incorporating relevant search terms such as marketing agency website template, digital marketing portfolio, advertising firm layout, creative agency showcase, social media marketing portal, marketing consulting site, online branding agency, and content strategy platform. The theme offers a sleek, responsive, and visually appealing design that ensures seamless performance across desktops, tablets, and smartphones, enhancing user experience and accessibility while reflecting professionalism and credibility. Key features include SEO optimization, integration with analytics tools like Google Analytics, support for PPC, Google Ads, Facebook Ads, content marketing, blogging, video production, and social media management, enabling agencies to run effective campaigns and maximize ROI. It also supports essential plugins like HubSpot Marketing for lead generation, CRM integration, email marketing, and client management, as well as Contact Form 7 and Mailchimp for inquiries and newsletter campaigns. Customizable sections, portfolio showcases, service pages, client testimonials, call-to-action buttons, and banner sliders allow agencies to align the website with their branding and messaging, reinforcing identity and positioning while converting visitors into clients efficiently. With clean, performance-optimized code and cross-browser compatibility, Classic Marketing Agency provides a complete, high-performing platform for agencies seeking a professional online presence and digital growth."
    },
